OL,3,GNEWSATrackers locate 'island's first'
OL,4,AAsian hornet nest
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist electronic tracking
OL,7,Fequipment has helped locate what is
OL,8,Fbelieved to be the first yellow-legged
OL,9,FAsian hornet nest found on the Isle of
OL,10,FWight.
OL,12,FThe nest was located by the National
OL,13,FBee Unit (NBU) last week after an
OL,14,Finitial picture of a hornet was
OL,15,Fsubmitted on the Asian Hornet Watch app
OL,16,Fby a member of the public.
OL,18,FAsian hornets feed on insects and are a
OL,19,Fthreat to native bees, because they
OL,20,Flike to feed bee grubs and dismembered
OL,21,Fadult bee thoraxes to their young,
OL,22,Fbeekeepers say.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
