OL,3,GNEWSATrackers locate 'island's first'
OL,4,AAsian hornet nest
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiniature trackers were fitted to
OL,7,Fhornets in an attempt to trace their
OL,8,Fnest. The Isle of Wight Asian Hornet
OL,9,FTeam, which assisted the tracking
OL,10,Foperation, said islanders should
OL,11,F"remain vigilant" for signs of the
OL,12,Finsects and their nests.
